# Tecno CM6 mtk-pmic-keys: power key + extra shortcut button (scancode 0x25d).
# Stock mapped 605 to Transsion's custom SMART_BUTTON keycode; we map it to
# ASSIST so it launches the default assistant. A device-specific .kl replaces
# Generic.kl for this input device only; volume keys live on mtk-kpd.
key 116   POWER              # KEY_POWER
key 605   ASSIST             # extra shortcut button
